              "text": "{\"statements\":[{\"statement\":\"In non-arctic service, only Dexron® III is allowed in the 4L80-E transmission; Dexron® II may not be used.\",\"reason\":\"The non-arctic 4L80-E entry specifies Dexron® III only and expressly excludes Dexron® II.\",\"verdict\":1,\"evidence_ids\":[\"C001112\"],\"evidence_quotes\":[\"USAGE: Transmission\\n(4L80-E)\\nFLUID/LUBRICANT: Dexron\\n® III only\\n(Do not use Dexron® II)\\nCAPACITIES: Dry: 13.5 qt (12.8L)\\nDrain & Refill 7.7 qt (7.3 L)\\nEXPECTED TEMPERATURE: All Temperatures\\nExcept Arctic\"]},{\"statement\":\"In non-arctic service, using Dexron® II in the 4L80-E transmission will damage it.\",\"reason\":\"The caution says failure to use only Dexron® III will damage the 4L80-E transmission; the note gives a separate arctic instruction.\",\"verdict\":1,\"evidence_ids\":[\"C001054\"],\"evidence_quotes\":[\"Use only Dexron®\\nIII for 4L80-E transmission. Failure to\\nuse only Dexron® III for 4L80E\\ntransmission will cause damage to\\ntransmission.\",\"In\\narctic conditions, use OEA in both\\nmodel transmissions.\"]},{\"statement\":\"In non-arctic service, Dexron® II can be used to fill the transfer case regardless of transmission type.\",\"reason\":\"The transfer-case filling instruction specifies Dexron® II without a transmission-type qualification.\",\"verdict\":1,\"evidence_ids\":[\"C001063\"],\"evidence_quotes\":[\"Use Dexron® II for filling transfer\\ncase. Failure to use Dexron® II\\nwill cause damage to transfer case.\"]},{\"statement\":\"In non-arctic service, on level ground, the stated transfer-case level criterion for model 218 is a fill of 3.5 quarts (3.3 L).\",\"reason\":\"The source gives 3.5 quarts as a fill amount, not as a level criterion on level ground.\",\"verdict\":0,\"evidence_ids\":[],\"evidence_quotes\":[]},{\"statement\":\"In non-arctic service, on level ground, the stated transfer-case level criterion for model 242 is a fill of 3.35 quarts (3.17 L).\",\"reason\":\"The source gives 3.35 quarts as a fill amount, not as a level criterion on level ground.\",\"verdict\":0,\"evidence_ids\":[],\"evidence_quotes\":[]}]}",
